---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { outfits } from '../../modules/intranet/outfits.js';
import { members } from '../../modules/intranet/members.js';
---
<Layout title="Mi intranet | Banda Bruna" description="Agenda privada del equipo Banda Bruna">
<link slot="head" rel="manifest" href="/intranet.webmanifest" />
<link slot="head" rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/logos/push-192.png" />
<meta slot="head" name="theme-color" content="#090f1c" />
<meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
<main class="intranet">
  <header><div><p class="eyebrow">BANDA BRUNA · EQUIPO</p><h1>Mi intranet</h1><p id="identity">Verificando tu sesión…</p></div><div><a href="/admin/dashboard">Administración</a> <button id="logout">Cerrar sesión</button></div></header>
  <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="workspace" hidden>
    <section class="welcome"><h2>Todo listo para el próximo escenario</h2><p>Tu agenda, indicaciones y material de la banda en un solo lugar.</p><strong id="unread"></strong><button data-filter="pendientes">Ver avisos sin leer</button> <button id="refresh">Actualizar avisos</button></section>
    <section id="push-controls" class="push-controls" hidden><strong>Avisos en mi celular</strong><p id="push-state" role="status">Comprobando disponibilidad…</p><button id="push-enable" type="button">Activar notificaciones</button><button id="push-disable" type="button" hidden>Desactivar en este dispositivo</button><details><summary>Cómo activar en Android</summary><p>Abre la intranet en Chrome, inicia sesión, toca Activar notificaciones y elige Permitir. Si no aparecen, revisa que Chrome y Banda Bruna tengan permitidas las notificaciones en los ajustes de Android. Puedes agregar la intranet a la pantalla de inicio para abrirla fácilmente.</p></details><details><summary>Cómo activar en iPhone</summary><p>En Safari: Compartir → Agregar a Inicio. Abre la intranet desde ese icono, inicia sesión y toca Activar notificaciones. Requiere iOS 16.4 o posterior. La entrega también depende de tus ajustes de notificaciones y concentración.</p></details></section>
    <section id="section-picker" aria-label="Accesos de mi intranet">
      <div class="picker-heading"><p class="eyebrow">TU ESPACIO PERSONAL</p><h2>¿Qué quieres revisar?</h2><p>Selecciona una sección para ver su información.</p></div>
      <nav class="section-cards" aria-label="Secciones de la intranet">
        <button data-filter="agenda" class="section-card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 3v4m8-4v4M4 10h16M5 5h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14H4V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z"/></svg></span><span class="card-title">Agenda</span><span class="card-description">Fechas, shows y tenidas</span></button>
        <button data-filter="ensayo" class="section-card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 18V5l11-2v13M9 9l11-2"/><ellipse cx="6" cy="18" rx="3" ry="2.5"/><ellipse cx="17" cy="16" rx="3" ry="2.5"/></svg></span><span class="card-title">Ensayos</span><span class="card-description">Planes y dirección musical</span></button>
        <button data-filter="material" class="section-card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v5h16v-5M12 3v13m-5-5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></span><span class="card-title">Material</span><span class="card-description">Repertorios, canciones y archivos</span></button>
        <button data-filter="personal" class="section-card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/></svg></span><span class="card-title">Para mí</span><span class="card-description">Indicaciones personales</span></button>
      </nav>
      <div class="picker-actions"><button data-filter="todos" class="quiet-action">Ver toda la información →</button><button id="open-publisher" hidden>+ Enviar información</button></div>
    </section>
    <section id="section-content" hidden>
      <div class="section-heading"><button id="back-sections">← Volver a mi intranet</button><h2 id="section-title" tabindex="-1">Tu información</h2></div>
      <div class="columns">
      <section id="repertoire-library" hidden><h2>Biblioteca musical</h2><p id="library-count"></p><div class="library-toolbar"><label>Buscar mix, canción o tonalidad<input type="search" id="library-search" placeholder="Ej.: Viking, Macondo, Dm…" /></label><label>Sección<select id="library-category"></select></label></div><label class="missing-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="library-missing" /> Mostrar solo audios pendientes</label><p id="library-missing-list" class="music-note"></p><div id="library-results"></div><h2 class="material-notices-title">Avisos y archivos compartidos</h2></section>
      <section id="feed-section"><div id="feed"></div></section>
    <aside><section id="publisher" hidden><h2>Enviar información</h2><p>Se notificará dentro de la intranet a los destinatarios.</p>
      <form id="publish-form">
        <label>Tipo<select name="kind" id="kind"></select></label>
        <label>Título<input name="title" required maxlength="200" /></label>
        <label>Indicaciones generales<textarea name="body" rows="5" maxlength="20000"></textarea></label>
        <section id="music-picker" hidden><h3>Repertorio seleccionable</h3><p>Elige mixes completos o canciones; define el orden y las indicaciones de cada selección.</p><details id="repertoire-picker"><summary>+ Abrir catálogo de repertorio</summary><label>Buscar en el catálogo<input type="search" id="picker-search" placeholder="Buscar mix o canción…" /></label><div id="picker-results"></div></details><strong id="music-selected-count">0 seleccionados</strong><div id="music-selected"></div><button type="button" id="draft-music-pdf">↓ Descargar PDF del plan / evento</button><p id="pdf-status" role="status"></p></section>
        <fieldset id="rehearsal-fields" hidden><legend>Trabajo interno</legend>
        <label>Trabajo interno y con quién<textarea name="internal_work" rows="2"></textarea></label>



        </fieldset>
        <label>Destinatarios<select name="recipients" id="recipients" multiple size="7"></select><small>Sin selección: todos los integrantes.</small></label>
        <label>Fecha y hora de tocata / ensayo (Chile)<input name="starts_at" type="datetime-local" /></label>
        <label>Lugar / evento<input name="location" maxlength="300" /></label>
        <fieldset id="event-fields" hidden><legend>Ficha del evento</legend><label>Vincular a fecha oficial de la banda<select id="official-event" name="official_event_id"><option value="">Actividad independiente</option></select></label><p id="official-date-hint">Las fechas oficiales se actualizan desde la agenda de la banda. Vincula una para agregar su ficha interna sin duplicarla.</p><label>Tipo de actividad<select name="event_category"><option value="tocata">Tocata</option><option value="especial">Evento especial</option><option value="junta">Junta / reunión</option></select></label><label>Estado de la fecha<select name="event_status"><option value="confirmado">Confirmado</option><option value="presupuestado">Presupuestado / por confirmar</option></select></label>
        <label>Horario de salida (Chile)<input name="departure_at" type="datetime-local" /></label>
        <label>Punto de encuentro / salida<input name="meeting_point" maxlength="300" /></label>
        <p>El horario de tocata se indica arriba. El valor a recibir se muestra de forma personal a cada integrante.</p>
        <details><summary>Pagos por integrante · CLP</summary>{members.map(m=><label>{m[1]}<input name={`payment_${m[0]}`} type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="1" placeholder="Por confirmar" /></label>)}</details>
        </fieldset>
        <div id="outfit-fields" hidden><h3>Elegir tenida</h3><p>Selecciona una tarjeta para dejar la tenida asociada al evento.</p><input type="hidden" name="outfit_slug" id="outfit-slug" /><div class="outfit-grid">{outfits.map(outfit=><button type="button" class="outfit-card" data-outfit-slug={outfit.id} aria-pressed="false"><img src={outfit.cloudinaryUrl||outfit.image} alt={`Tenida LEGO ${outfit.name}`} loading="lazy" width="720" height="480"/><strong>{outfit.name}</strong>{outfit.suggested&&<small>Combinación propuesta</small>}<span>{outfit.description}</span></button>)}</div><p id="outfit-choice" role="status">Ninguna tenida seleccionada.</p><details><summary>Otras tenidas registradas</summary><label>Tenida<select name="outfit_id" id="outfits"><option value="">Seleccionar tenida</option></select></label><button type="button" id="new-outfit">+ Registrar tenida</button></details></div>
        <label>Modo del mix<select name="mix_mode"><option value="">No aplica</option><option value="secuencia">Con secuencia</option><option value="bruto">En bruto</option><option value="mixto">Mixto (detallar en indicaciones)</option></select></label>
        <label>Checklist (una indicación por línea)<textarea name="checklist" id="checklist" rows="5" placeholder="Llevar body cargado&#10;Llevar audífonos in ear"></textarea></label>
        <button type="button" id="checklist-template">Agregar recordatorios habituales</button>
        <label>Archivo privado (máx. 50 MB)<input name="file" type="file" accept=".pdf,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp,.docx" /></label>
        <div id="event-pdf-options" hidden><label>Previsualizar consolidado para<select id="pdf-for-member" name="pdf_for_member">{members.map(m=><option value={m[0]}>{m[1]}</option>)}</select></label></div>
        <button type="submit" id="send">Publicar y avisar</button>
      </form>
    </section><section class="help" hidden><h2>Tu espacio personal</h2><p>Marca cada aviso como leído y completa tu checklist. Las indicaciones personales solo las ven el destinatario y quien las envía.</p><p>Los horarios se muestran en hora de Chile.</p></section></aside></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<script>import '../../modules/intranet/client';</script>
</Layout>
<style>
.intranet{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:48px 24px 80px;color:#e2e8f0}.intranet header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px}.intranet h1{font-size:36px;font-weight:800}.intranet h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}.eyebrow{color:#d8b36a;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:11px}.intranet p{color:#a9b6c9;margin-bottom:12px}.welcome,.help,#publisher,.intranet :global(.entry){padding:24px;background:#111b2c;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px}.welcome{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#243045,#141d29)}.columns{display:block;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}.intranet nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}.intranet button,.intranet a,.intranet :global(.file-link){display:inline-block;border:1px solid #42516a;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.intranet button:hover,.intranet button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#d8b36a;color:#101722}.intranet label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:14px 0}.intranet input,.intranet select,.intranet textarea{display:block;width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid #42516a;border-radius:7px;background:#090f1c;color:white}.intranet small{display:block;color:#a9b6c9;margin-top:5px}.intranet :global(.entry-body){white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.intranet :global(.entry-meta){font-size:12px;color:#d8b36a;margin-bottom:12px}.intranet :global(.entry label){display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}.intranet :global(.entry input){width:auto;margin:0}.intranet :global(audio){width:100%;margin:12px 0}#status{color:#f3ce82}#unread{display:block;margin:12px 0}.intranet button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:800px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intranet header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.intranet{padding:28px 16px}}

#section-picker,#section-content{scroll-margin-top:90px}#section-picker{padding:24px 0 12px}.picker-heading{text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px}.picker-heading h2{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.025em}.intranet .section-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:0}.intranet .section-card{background:rgb(15 23 42 / .6);border:1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / .05);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;transition:transform .25s,border-color .25s,box-shadow .25s;min-height:180px}.intranet .section-card:hover,.intranet .section-card:focus-visible{background:rgb(15 23 42 / .8);border-color:rgb(216 179 106 / .4);transform:scale(1.03);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgb(216 179 106 / .05);color:white}.card-icon{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#020617;color:#d8b36a}.card-icon svg{width:24px;height:24px}.card-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:white}.card-description{font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center}.picker-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.intranet .quiet-action{border-color:transparent;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px}.section-heading{max-width:900px;margin:28px auto 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.section-heading h2{margin:0}#publisher{max-width:900px}.welcome{padding:20px 24px}.welcome h2{font-size:18px}@media(max-width:700px){.intranet .section-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.intranet .section-card{min-height:160px;padding:22px 12px}.picker-heading h2{font-size:24px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.intranet .section-card{transition:none}.intranet .section-card:hover{transform:none}}

.intranet :global(.music-category),.intranet :global(.selected-music),#repertoire-picker{border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:12px;margin:14px 0;padding:18px}.intranet :global(summary){cursor:pointer;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 0}.intranet :global(.music-category>summary){display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.intranet :global(.music-category>summary span){color:#d8b36a}.intranet :global(.music-item){padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid #283347}.intranet :global(.music-item-header){display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.intranet :global(.music-item h3),.intranet :global(.selected-music h3){font-size:16px;font-weight:700}.intranet :global(.music-note){font-size:12px;color:#a9b6c9;margin-top:10px}.intranet :global(.music-missing){font-size:12px;color:#e6b56f;margin-top:10px}.intranet :global(.music-audio){display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.intranet :global(.music-audio audio){flex:1;min-width:200px;max-width:500px}.intranet :global(.music-tracks li){display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #283347}.intranet :global(.music-tracks ol){list-style:decimal;padding-left:20px}.intranet :global(.music-tracks strong){font-size:12px;color:#d8b36a}.library-toolbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.intranet .missing-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.intranet .missing-toggle input{width:auto;margin:0}#music-selected-count{display:block;color:#d8b36a;margin:20px 0}#music-picker{margin:20px 0}.intranet :global(.published-music){border-top:1px solid #283347;padding-top:16px;margin:20px 0}.intranet :global(.published-music li){padding:4px 0}.material-notices-title{margin-top:36px}@media(max-width:600px){.library-toolbar{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.intranet :global(.music-item-header){flex-wrap:wrap}}

.push-controls{border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:20px}.push-controls p{font-size:12px;margin:8px 0}.push-controls summary{font-size:12px;margin-top:10px}
.outfit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:18px 0}.intranet .outfit-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;text-align:left;padding:12px;background:#0a1221;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:14px}.outfit-card img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:contain;background:white;border-radius:8px}.outfit-card strong{font-size:15px}.outfit-card span{font-size:11px;color:#a9b6c9}.intranet .outfit-card[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#d8b36a;background:#27261e;color:#f4dcac}.intranet .outfit-card:hover{background:#1a2639;color:white}.intranet :global(.event-outfit){width:100%;max-width:600px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;background:white;margin:14px 0}.intranet :global(.event-data){display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:14px 0}.intranet :global(.event-data p){margin:0;padding:12px;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:9px;font-size:13px}.intranet :global(.personal-task){display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px}.intranet :global(.entry .personal-task label){flex:1}.intranet :global(.entry input[data-new-task]){width:100%;padding:10px;background:#090f1c;color:white;border:1px solid #42516a}.intranet :global(.entry details){margin:18px 0}#event-fields{padding:16px;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:12px;margin:20px 0}@media(max-width:550px){.outfit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intranet :global(.event-data){grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.intranet :global(.schedule-intro h3),.intranet :global(.calendar-toolbar h3){font-size:26px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:capitalize}.intranet :global(.schedule-intro){margin-bottom:24px}.intranet :global(.schedule-intro p){font-size:13px}.intranet :global(.schedule-table-wrap){overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:14px;background:#101827;margin:20px 0}.intranet :global(.schedule-table){width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:760px;table-layout:fixed}.intranet :global(.schedule-table caption){text-align:left;padding:16px 20px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px}.intranet :global(.schedule-table th){text-align:left;background:#182338;color:#c1cbd9;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:16px}.intranet :global(.schedule-table td){vertical-align:top;padding:20px 16px;border-top:1px solid #283347;font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.intranet :global(.schedule-table th:nth-child(1)){width:17%}.intranet :global(.schedule-table th:nth-child(2)){width:23%}.intranet :global(.schedule-table th:nth-child(3)){width:38%}.intranet :global(.schedule-table th:nth-child(4)){width:22%}.intranet :global(.agenda-table th:nth-child(2)){width:30%}.intranet :global(.agenda-table th:nth-child(3)){width:31%}.intranet :global(.schedule-table td>span),.intranet :global(.schedule-table td>strong){display:block}.intranet :global(.date-large){font-size:21px;color:#f4d391;font-weight:750;text-transform:capitalize;margin-bottom:5px}.intranet :global(.time-large){font-size:19px;color:white;margin-bottom:8px}.intranet :global(.next-rehearsal){display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:22px 24px;border:1px solid #8c7445;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#302a1c,#111b2b)}.intranet :global(.next-rehearsal>span){font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#e5c27f;font-weight:700}.intranet :global(.next-rehearsal .date-large){display:block;font-size:28px}.intranet :global(.next-rehearsal div>span){display:block;font-size:12px}.intranet :global(.setlist-compact){list-style:decimal;padding-left:18px}.intranet :global(.setlist-compact li){padding:0 0 16px 5px}.intranet :global(.setlist-compact p){font-size:12px;margin:6px 0 0;color:#aab7ca}.intranet :global(.track-links){display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:7px}.intranet :global(.track-links a){font-size:11px;padding:5px 7px;border-color:#3a4d66;color:#8fcbf4}.intranet :global(.track-links small){width:100%;font-size:10px}.intranet :global(.schedule-table details summary){font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#d8b36a}.intranet :global(.schedule-table .entry){padding:14px;margin-top:14px}.intranet :global(.schedule-table .entry h2){font-size:15px}.intranet :global(.calendar-toolbar){display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.intranet :global(.calendar-toolbar nav){margin:0;display:flex;gap:7px}.intranet :global(.calendar-stats){display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.intranet :global(.calendar-stats>span){background:#111b2c;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;color:#aebdd0}.intranet :global(.calendar-stats b){font-size:20px;color:white;padding-right:7px}.intranet :global(.calendar-scroll){overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:14px}.intranet :global(.month-grid){display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));min-width:600px;background:#111b2c;gap:1px}.intranet :global(.weekday){padding:13px;text-align:center;background:#182338;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.intranet :global(.calendar-day){display:flex;align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;gap:6px;min-height:110px;padding:10px;background:#0b1322;border:0;border-radius:0;text-align:left}.intranet :global(.calendar-day:hover),.intranet :global(.calendar-day.is-selected){background:#25344b;color:white}.intranet :global(.day-number){font-size:12px;color:#9baac0}.intranet :global(.is-today .day-number){background:#d8b36a;color:#101722;border-radius:50%;width:24px;height:24px;text-align:center;line-height:24px;font-weight:800}.intranet :global(.calendar-event){font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;border-left:2px solid #d8b36a;background:#31291a;color:#f4d391}.intranet :global(.calendar-event.is-rehearsal){border-color:#60a5fa;background:#152d47;color:#a9d2fa}.intranet :global(.calendar-event small){font-size:9px;color:inherit;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}.intranet :global(.calendar-empty){background:#0a111e}.intranet :global(.upcoming-heading){display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}.intranet :global(.upcoming-heading h3),.intranet :global(.director-personal h3){font-size:20px;font-weight:700}.intranet :global(.type-pill){width:fit-content;background:#25334b;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:5px;color:#9bc8f4;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:8px}.intranet :global(.tentative){color:#e3bd73}.intranet :global(.director-personal),.intranet :global(.unscheduled){border:1px solid #283347;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;margin-top:24px}.intranet :global(.muted){color:#94a3b8}.columns:has(.month-grid),.columns:has(.schedule-table){max-width:1200px}@media(max-width:650px){.intranet :global(.calendar-toolbar){align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.intranet :global(.next-rehearsal){gap:14px}.intranet :global(.calendar-stats){gap:6px}.intranet :global(.calendar-stats>span){padding:8px 10px}.intranet :global(.schedule-table){min-width:720px}}

</style>
